5,1,1,talk,Minako,,Our current habit isn't working. We need a system for the year that is realistic about the time required.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. It feels uneven lately. We should look at the actual usage versus the workload.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I just want it to be clean! Sometimes it's great and sometimes it's scary in there.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It would be lovely to have a clear plan. I also wonder if we can clarify how we handle the costs of supplies.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Let us be careful. The goal is a system that keeps us friends, not just a clean floor.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, if we want logic, we need data. I'll check the actual timing of the cleaning.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Good idea. I'll look into the usage patterns and the calendar to see who is actually here.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"I want to know why it changes so much. I'll check what everyone thinks ""done"" means.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I will look into the receipts and the management office rates to see our options.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,I shall look into the history of this house and the nature of our past disagreements.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,I'll also check the outside firm's terms to see if that's a viable time-saver.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I'll add the kitchen use watch to my list to be thorough.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I'll check the bathroom grout too, to see if it's just a ventilation problem.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I'll check the spray stock as well to see if we are wasting money.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will review the house chat and the note from the previous tenants.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
