33,2,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Servas,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Minako,,A full pass takes over an hour and a half. An outside firm requires us to tidy up first anyway.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It's unfair. Some of us are barely here, yet a few people do almost all the cooking and cleaning.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The grout gets black in eleven days! Also, we all have different ideas of what ""clean"" actually means.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"We are spending 2,300 yen a month on supplies, often buying duplicates. The office cleaner is 4,200 yen an hour.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The previous tenants stopped speaking because of permanent assignments. Our own chat shows we fight when reminding each other.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shizue, that hourly rate is high, but if it saves us ninety minutes of labor, it might be worth it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, but if the usage is concentrated on two people, should the others pay the same?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"If we don't agree on a standard, any rota will just lead to more fighting about the grout.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,I'm worried about who is paying for the bleach. We need a way to settle up monthly.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,We must avoid any system that creates permanent resentment or requires constant nagging.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,"A rota is predictable, but it doesn't account for the actual time spent or the usage Benjamin mentioned.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,Exactly. A fixed rota ignores that some people are away for a whole month.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,But permanent assignments would be so confusing if the standards keep shifting.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"A paid service would be the most transparent for billing, provided we split it fairly.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Permanent assignments are a recipe for disaster, as the previous tenants discovered.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minako,,We need to decide if we value our time or our money more.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,And whether we value strict equality or proportional fairness.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I just want a bathroom that doesn't feel grim!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shizue,,Let's consider the options and see which one keeps us all happy and honest.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,Harmony is the only metric that truly matters for a year-long arrangement.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
