60,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Option B, the paid service, removes the time burden, though we still have to tidy.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Option A is the most logically ""fair"" on paper, even if the usage varies.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Sakura,,I dislike Option C because the quality would vary too much between people.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Option B allows for a clear monthly invoice, which solves my concern about the wallet.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,Option C is out. The previous tenants' note was a warning we cannot ignore.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, a rota still takes ninety minutes of my time every turn. That's a lot.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"True, but Option B is expensive. 4,200 yen an hour adds up quickly.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"But if a professional does it, the grout might actually stay clean!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shizue,,We are already wasting money on duplicate sprays; a professional might be more efficient.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"A paid service removes the need to remind each other, which stops the rows.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minako,,I vote for the paid service. My time is too valuable to spend on scrubbing.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I'm torn, but for the sake of house harmony, I'll lean toward the service.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Sakura,,I vote for the paid service! I want it consistently clean.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. The financial transparency of a single invoice is very appealing.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,I also vote for the paid service. It is the safest path to peace.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
